# The upstream faer release the fork is based on.
#
# Determined, not assumed from a version string: at the fork revision above,
# `git describe --tags --abbrev=0 HEAD` is `faer-v0.24.4`; that tag is an ancestor
# of the fork revision and `faer-v0.24.5` is not, so the fork sits on the 0.24.4
# release rather than on a later one. It agrees with the fork's own
# `faer/Cargo.toml` (package version 0.24.4), its `CHANGELOG.md` (the `# 0.24`
# section), and the fork's `PATCHSET.md`, which records the published
# `t4a-faer 0.24.4` release. The tag resolves to
# 0539947ffb757a739d7e703a7d2fa0c792a909c1 ("chore: Release").
faer-v0.24.4
